{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52441","headline":"回波乐 八十四 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 八十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身体骨崖崖，面皮千道皱。\n行时头即低，策杖与人语。\n眼中双泪流，鼻涕（一作「满」）垂入口。\n腰似断（一作「就」）弦弓，引气{口廋}喘急（一作「𪢐」）\n口里无牙齿，强嫌寡妇丑。\n闻好不惜钱，急送一榼酒。\n前人许赐（一作「赐许」）婚，判命（一作「死」）向前走。\n迎得少年妻，褒扬殊面首。\n傍边乾咽唾，恰（一作「怜」）似守碓狗。\n舂人收糠将，舐略（项校「掠」）空唇口。\n忽逢三煞头，一棒即了手。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}